88\", \"tests/d55-outbound-live.test.ts\"], \"notes\": \"Grant-gated components refuse without matching witnessed grant; publish/gmail return honest authorized-not-delivered receipts — never fabricated effects; failures don't consume the one-shot grant.\" },\n    { \"id\": \"S-chat-invocation\", \"score\": 0.85, \"evidence_class\": \"repository\", \"evidence\": [\"src/chat-parse/packs/index.ts\", \"src/tools/chat-turn-tools.ts:101\", \"tests/s151-conversation-need-response-unified.test.ts\", \"tests/s169-run-chat-turn-tool.test.ts\", \"tests/s281-parse-chat-lexicon.test.ts\"], \"notes\": \"Intent packs (mail/list/mint/book-find/permission/topic) classify chat into needs while need:response carries the conversational reply; needs remain distinguishable rows.\" },\n    { \"id\": \"S-focused-need\", \"score\": 0.7, \"evidence_class\": \"repository\", \"evidence\": [\"tests/s126-typed-focus.test.ts\", \"src/tools/tool-interface.ts:765\", \"src/tools/open-needs.ts\", \"src/tools/chat-lane.ts\"], \"notes\": \"Typed focus reference, open-need gate, and conversational refinement exist; a direct 'move this need into focus and fill its slots in chat' affordance is partially evidenced — mechanism plausible, flow not fully confirmed.\" }\n  ],\n  \"capability_manifest\": [\n    { \"area\": \"assertion ledger (append-only, typed values, claimant, certainty, basis, supersession)\", \"status\": \"implemented\", \"evidence\": [\"src/ledger/types.ts:30\", \"src/ledger/store.ts:275\"] },\n    { \"area\": \"computed views / profiles (renderSubjectView, supersession+trust resolution)\", \"status\": \"implemented\", \"evidence\": [\"src/ledger/store.ts:369\", \"SPEC.md:42\"] },\n    { \"area\": \"unmet needs / tool-call floor (need:* lifecycle, open/cancel/fulfill/supersede, drain)\", \"status\": \"implemented\", \"evidence\": [\"src/tools/needs.ts:109\", \"src/tools/needs.ts:851\", \"src/tools/open-needs.ts\"] },\n    { \"area\": \"tool templates, slots, acceptance gates (evaluateToolG