{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"oasis-diagnostic","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"\n\nI'm integrating an ethics gate into persona creation, checking for liveness and objections before minting. This requires refactoring `create-persona` into a function-backed approach that calls the new `ethics.gate` system command first. If the gate passes, persona minting proceeds; otherwise, it's refused or requires admonishment. I'll also add `fn_persona_extend` to handle generated needs like portraits and characterization."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-21T05:52:54.799146800+00:00"}}}}
{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"oasis-diagnostic","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"\n\nI'm refining the conversation archiving mechanism by defining `conversation_archive` to segment chat history and `fn_archive_seal` to create durable archive entries upon topic closure or chat clearing. New tools like `archive-view` and `archive-seal` are registered in `builtins2.py`. Edits to `builtins.py` ensure sequential speech composition via `fn_serve_response_need` and route speech through a floor queue in `cmd_persona_speak`, with `fn_speak_voice` handling voice preference ranking."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-21T05:52:57.122495500+00:00"}}}}
{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"oasis-diagnostic","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"\n\nI'm adding a \"temporal-attention\" duty to `fn_steward_tick` and will keep `fn_parse_chat`. The `create-persona` function will be refactored to be function-backed, removing old step registrations in favor of a direct re-registration with `fn`. For `run-search`, I'll upgrade it to fan out to configured sources like Wikipedia, using `C-MultiSourceAccess` and tracking source usage per hit. New internal additions are planned for orchestrators, and `clear-chat`/`close-topic` will include an archive seal step."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-21T05:52:59.573775500+00:00"}}}}
{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"oasis-diagnostic","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"\n\nThe UI's speech path needs to be clarified; the host SAPI floor is the current path, and cards should display `voice.name` alongside `speechOrder`. I'm considering adding \"archive\" and \"connectors\" tabs, potentially merging \"connectors\" into \"command,\" to the existing set of tabs. A fullscreen button is also a straightforward addition. The mint modal is currently prompt-based, but I'll extend it to ask for imitation details, keeping the initial minting minimal via prompt for the name and adding fields later. For scenario enactment, minting will occur via API/script."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-21T05:53:01.900439500+00:00"}}}}
