{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"oasis-diagnostic","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"I've found a bug in `fn_set_build_collect`: I'm calling the retrieval tools twice unnecessarily. I'll fix this by removing the `per_source` loop and relying solely on `members_by_tool`. After that, I'll create the `ethics.py`, `archive.py`, and `builtins2.py` files, wire everything together, and run the system."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-21T05:54:49.840776600+00:00"}}}}
