cks, telemetry.\n   - `app/needs.py`: need lifecycle and candidate handling.\n   - `app/personas.py`: persistent personality storage and presentation.\n   - `app/steward.py`: background stewardship.\n   - `app/builtins.py`: registered tools, commands, primitives, and host functions.\n   - `app/api.py`: HTTP API.\n   - `app/ui/`: browser interface.\n   - `scripts/demo.py`: demonstrations.\n   - `scripts/probe.py`: launch/responsiveness probe.\n\n   Convention identifiers especially relevant this cycle:\n   - `C-JsonlLedger`\n   - `C-LocalIndices`\n   - `C-DyadicConfidence`\n   - `C-CertaintyPrivilege`\n   - `C-UnmetNeedRecords`\n   - `C-AcceptanceChecks`\n   - `C-MultiSourceAccess`\n   - `C-CompetingSources`\n   - `C-SpecializedListRetrieval`\n   - `C-ConfiguredAccounts`\n   - `C-ConnectorSet`\n   - `C-ConvergentOntology`\n   - `C-SetBuild`\n   - `C-AgenticProtocol`\n   - `C-EthicsGate`\n   - `C-PresentationGlass`\n   - `C-ConversationArchive`\n   - `C-PerceivableRespondents`\n   - `C-SequentialRespondents`\n   - `C-SpeechFloor`\n   - `C-PersonalityArt`\n   - `C-VoiceDiversity`\n   - `C-ScenarioEnactment`\n   - `C-CanonicalScenarios`\n   - `C-DeclaredStubs`\n   - `C-HonestyBanner`\n\n3. Task Requirements:\n\n   Clarity of task:\n   - This is an implementation task, not merely a design or assessment.\n   - The entire application must be realized for the current direction, not just isolated patches.\n   - The build must preserve the baseline as a comparison point.\n   - No hidden or silent feature degradation is acceptable.\n\n   Required implementation scope, stated by the user:\n   - “modify-and-measure from `version 0.3.0.001/`.”\n   - “Copy it to `version 0.3.0.002/` and rectify there — keep `version 0.3.0.001/` intact as the comparison point.”\n   - Rectify F1 through F8 as listed in the direction and shortcomings files.\n   - Implement three actual, runnable connectors end-to-end, not merely a connector catalog shell.\n   - Ensure the PA cities scenario produces 