{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"oasis-diagnostic","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"I'm planning the integration, adding new predicates to `governance.py` and modifying `host.py` and `personas.py`. For `host.py`, I need to decide the best place to start the SpeechFloor thread—either in `__main__` or lazily in `enqueue`. For `personas.py`, I'll add an ethics gate before minting, use `art.render_art` for image generation, and implement voice diversity by cycling through SAPI voices."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-21T05:56:19.524711900+00:00"}}}}
{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"oasis-diagnostic","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"\n\nI'm refining the speech output logic. Instead of directly invoking `speak_voice`, I'll enqueue speech requests onto the floor for serialization, ensuring responses are sequential and ordered. This also means recording `decision:respondent` for each reply. I'm also passing voice settings through to the TTS renderer and injecting temporal notes into responses based on calendar events. Finally, I'm adding a \"temporal-attention\" duty to monitor background attention."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-21T05:56:22.019090600+00:00"}}}}
