{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"oasis-diagnostic","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"I'm reviewing the `builtins.py` patches. It looks like `cmd_persona_mint` needs to handle refusals, and `cmd_persona_speak` should manage the F6 enqueue. The `fn_serve_response_need` function requires sequential indexing, while `compose_for` needs a temporal note. I also see voice passthrough in `fn_speak_voice` and voice parameters in `fn_render_speech_sapi`. `fn_steward_tick` handles temporal-attention duties, `fn_generate_portrait` deals with art rendering, and `fn_build_list` delegates to geo-set. Finally, there are several new functions and registrations including `characterize-persona`, `persona-onboard`, `setbuild tools`, `compare-run`, `connectors`, `archive`, `temporal`, and `voice-set`."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-21T05:57:01.600484500+00:00"}}}}
