{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"oasis-diagnostic","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"I'm adding new functions for persona onboarding, characterization, connectors, archiving, temporal operations, and voice settings, along with internal additions and registrations. I'll avoid multiline quoting issues by appending functions to `builtins.py` using an `edit` operation, anchoring at `def _run_search` or the end of the file, and handling registrations similarly."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-21T05:58:29.455974900+00:00"}}}}
{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"oasis-diagnostic","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"\n\nI'm closing the need with the `fulfilled` status, which seems correct. The `needs` module is imported as `needs` in builtins, and the `characterization` kind is covered by the `need:open` predicate. The subject predicate on `need:` rows is also correctly written as `need:open`."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-21T05:58:32.743900300+00:00"}}}}
