{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"oasis-diagnostic","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"\n\nI'm generating a characterization for a persona, pulling traits and interests to form a descriptive text. If the LLM returns a stub, I'll construct a default characterization. This text is then saved to the persona's lens summary and registered with the context. I'm also defining new functions for comparing runs, configuring connectors, and running connectors, ensuring they handle input parameters and context correctly."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-21T05:58:35.332815700+00:00"}}}}
