{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"oasis-diagnostic","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"\n\nI'm adding several new functions: `fn_connector_run` for executing connectors, `fn_connector_status` for checking their status, `fn_archive_view` for accessing archived data with optional sealing, and `fn_temporal_context` for setting temporal horizons. I'm also implementing `fn_persona_voice_set` to update persona voice settings, including saving changes and registering them. These functions will be registered in `builtins.py` before the internal loop."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-21T05:58:38.289204+00:00"}}}}
{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"oasis-diagnostic","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"\n\nI'm registering several new functions related to persona management and set building. These include functions for characterizing personas, onboarding them with various attributes, and modifying their voice settings. For set building, I'm adding functions to open projects, retrieve data from Wikipedia tables and categories, collect and compare retrieved sets, and run competitions over needs. Finally, I'm registering a function for configuring connectors."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-21T05:58:40.160379700+00:00"}}}}
