{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"oasis-diagnostic","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"It seems the pluralization is off for `kind` in both retrievers. `kind.title() + 's'` produces \"Citys\" instead of \"Cities\", which breaks both the category lookup and the page name for the table retriever. I'll add a `memberPlural` slot to handle this, mapping \"city\" to \"cities\" and using a simple pluralization rule for others."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-21T06:04:15.900954300+00:00"}}}}
