{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"oasis-diagnostic","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"I've found two bugs. First, city names have a trailing non-ASCII marker, likely a footnote symbol like `†` or `‡`, which I'm stripping with a regex. Second, duplicates like \"Allentown\" and \"Allentown\" were treated as distinct keys, but after cleaning, the count of unique cities is around 57, which seems correct."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-21T06:04:27.140319400+00:00"}}}}
