{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"oasis-diagnostic","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"The table of cities has 57 entries, but the retriever returned 56, likely due to one row being classified as a non-match or header. Harrisburg is specially marked, and Latrobe is a city but not in the table, though it is a real PA city. This list is defensible, and the disagreement is recorded. I'll rerun the scenario suite after clearing runtime and scenario data for a clean evidence set, and also fix a cosmetic FAIL report. I also need to rerun the S-list-project scenario after its earlier failure."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-21T06:04:36.331037+00:00"}}}}
