{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"oasis-diagnostic","update":{"sessionUpdate":"tool_call_update","toolCallId":"exec:0#d7793b78d77a45d2a93e36a4c2537aea","status":"in_progress","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"# FEATURES.md — Meridian (version 0.3.0.001) capability manifest\n\nClassification: **parity** = functional coverage of a feature GreyAvatar\ndelivers; **new** = capability beyond the reference (incl. rectified\nshortcomings); **absent** = not implemented (declared, not faked).\n\nReference: `C:\\Users\\kris_\\CursorProjects\\GreyAvatar`. This build is a fresh\nPython-stdlib implementation — no code ported; architecture re-derived from\n`prompt.md`.\n\n## Truth model\n\n| Capability | Class | Where |\n|---|---|---|\n| Append-only assertion ledger, durable JSONL, restart reload | parity | `app/ledger.py` |\n| Typed values (`string/number/boolean/enum/ref/list/map`), closed claimant vocabulary, governed predicate namespaces |\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\nparity | `app/model.py`, `app/governance.py` |\n| Computed views (`render_view`): supersession + trust resolution at read time; no second store | parity | `ledger.rend\u001b[0me\u001b[0m\nr_view` |\n| Source-bounded confidence: effective = min(certainty, context, source ceiling); recency breaks ties | parity | `ledge\u001b[0mr\u001b[0m\n.effective_confidence` |\n| Basis kinds: captured-input / interpretation / source-evidence / generated / execution / user-choice / durable-result\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\n/ import / refusal | parity | `model.BASIS_KINDS` |\n| Candidate slots inspectable with source + confidence until a tool selects | parity | `ledger.candidates_for`, `needs.\u001b[0mc\u001b[0m\nandidates` |\n| Contextual confidence (applicability) carried separately from certainty | parity | `Assertion.context` |\n\n## Components & needs\n\n| Capability | Class | Where |\n|---|---|---|\n| Component ontology: tool (data) / system-command (`object.verb`) / primitive (closed allow-list) | parity | `app/tool\u001b[0ms\u001b[0m\n.py`, `app/builtins.py` |\n| Tool-logic-as-data: closed-op interpreter (`set/query/search/view/candidates/append/appendEach/when/invoke/invokeEach\u001b[0m/\u001b[0m\nengine/emit/repeat/result/fail`), no eval | parity | `app/dsl.py` |\n| Single write seam `ledger.append`; other stores via system commands | parity | `ctx.append`, `COMMANDS` |\n| Unmet needs (`need:*`): open floor, gate eval, defer/cancel/supersede/fulfill, `need.fulfill` command | parity | `app\u001b[0m/\u001b[0m\nneeds.py`, `tools.fulfill_need` |\n| Templates: required/optional slots, `minCertainty`, grant requirement | parity | `spec.template`, `tools.evaluate_gat\u001b[0me\u001b[0m\n` |\n| Consumable, scoped, witnessed, lockable grants; ungranted consequential request = recorded deferral | parity | `tools\u001b[0m.\u001b[0m\nissue_grant`…, demo 10 |\n| Deferred work: missing slots leave need open with `need:deferred`; refinement via related assertions | parity | `need\u001b[0ms\u001b[0m\n.defer_need`, `needs.refine_need` |\n| Competing tools for the same need (`need:` expression) compared locally | parity | demo 7 |\n| **Bounded decision model for routing/evaluation — fixed feature vector, weighted sum, weights as ledger config, `deci\u001b[0ms\u001b[0m\nion:score`/`decision:respondent` traces, O(#tools×7) per decision** | **new (A9)** | `app/decision.py` |\n| **Tool-trust churn: inadequate/failed results lower a bounded rank multiplier [0.1–1.0] among alternatives without ma\u001b[0mk\u001b[0m\ning the tool ineligible; successes recover it** | **new (A5 / D-ToolTrustChurn)** | `decision.record_outcome`, demo 7 |\n| **Novice tool authoring: `validate-tool` (errors + warnings + repair hints), `create-tool`/`edit-tool`/`inspect-tool`\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\nwith telemetry view** | **new (A10)** | `fn_validate_tool`, Workshops tab |\n| 68 registered components at launch (30+ tools, 12 commands, 12 primitives) | parity-scale | registry manifest, probe |\n\n## Personalities\n\n| Capability | Class | Where |\n|---|---|---|\n| Persistent persona identities outside the ledger (`runtime/personalities.json`); `persona:*` assertions as ledger vie\u001b[0mw\u001b[0m\n | parity | `app/personas.py` |\n| Mint/edit persona, deterministic geometric SVG portrait + artifact | parity | `persona.mint`, `PortraitEngine` |\n| Imitation boundary: user admonished at mint; permanent `◆ IMITATION` mark on display + ledger rows | parity | `person\u001b[0ma\u001b[0m\ns.mint`, demo-adjacent |\n| **Respondent selection through the decision model (lens overlap, topic links, confidence, priority; `chat:response-de\u001b[0mp\u001b[0m\nth` caps count) — not coded rotation** | **new (A6)** | `select_respondents`, `decision.rank_personas` |\n| **Non-anthropomorphic presentation: personas are \"lenses/respondents\"; `user:persona-frame` selects `respondent`/`per\u001b[0ms\u001b[0m\nonified` display; no avatar vocabulary required** | **new (A12)** | `personas.frame`, Settings |\n| Distinct characterized replies per persona via lens (LLM when live; template fallback declared) | parity | `compose_f\u001b[0mo\u001b[0m\nr` |\n\n## Turn chain & surfaces\n\n| Capability | Class | Where |\n|---|---|---|\n| Chat turn: captured-input assertion → decision-model intents → `need:tool-request` per intent + `need:response` → dra\u001b[0mi\u001b[0m\nn → compose → `persona.speak` card | parity | `fn_run_chat_turn` |\n| One input can open several tool opportunities AND a conversation response | parity | `fn_parse_chat` |\n| Cards feed (persona / offer / witness kinds) routed via bus, replayable | parity | `host.Bus`, UI feed |\n| Chat lane: clear-chat boundary marker (append-only), set/close topic, all-chat flag | parity | chat lane tools |\n| Cross-turn memory: history since last clear-chat read into compose prompts — on all conversation paths | parity+ (the\u001b[0mi\u001b[0m\nr open deficit) | `chat_history` |\n| Web UI: chat, roster, command center, library, workshops, exchange, settings, log; honesty banner | parity-level | `a\u001b[0mp\u001b[0m\np/ui/` |\n| **Command center: projects + open-need queue + focus/calendar + grant requests on one surface; explicit create-projec\u001b[0mt\u001b[0m\n affordance** | **new (A4)** | Command tab |\n| **Library: assertion browser/search + computed-view inspector + append-only assertion editing (supersession supported\u001b[0m)\u001b[0m\n** | **new (B: library-mediated editing)** | Library tab, `/api/library/*` |\n| **Workshops: one generic renderer derives forms from `tool.template` (relationship-driven form derivation); proficien\u001b[0mc\u001b[0m\ny tier disclosure** | **new (B / A10)** | `openWorkshop`, `set-editor-proficiency` |\n| Mic: browser Web Speech → `device:speech-transcript` witness → turn; absent API declared, not faked | parity | UI mic\u001b[0m,\u001b[0m\n `transcribe-speech` |\n| TTS: `speak-voice` ranks renderers; local SAPI synthesis | parity-level | `fn_speak_voice` |\n| **Speech as independently-defined competing tools (local `render-speech-sapi` vs remote `render-speech-remote`, both \u001b[0mn\u001b[0m\need `speech.render`, ranked by outcomes; remote honestly unconfigured)** | **new (A13)** | speech tools |\n| Soundscape / camera / gallery theater | **absent** | declared |\n\n## Stewardship, projects, sources\n\n| Capability | Class | Where |\n|---|---|---|\n| Background steward: daemon thread running `steward-tick` tool; drains needs, countdown needs, calendar scan, source-c\u001b[0mo\u001b[0m\nnfidence, compact-check; each run recorded (`idle:steward-run`, ms) | parity | `app/steward.py`, `fn_steward_tick` |\n| **Stewardship configurable as ledger data: duties + interval via `assign-stewardship` (`routing:stewardship-assignmen\u001b[0mt\u001b[0m\n`), per-duty toggles** | **new (A3 / D-IdleTurnAsTool)** | `assign-stewardship`, Settings |\n| Responsiveness: steward never holds request path; probe measures API answer while tick runs | parity | `steward.py`, \u001b[0mp\u001b[0m\nrobe |\n| Projects: `project:*` subjects, goals as assertions, goals → linked needs, progress visible; create via chat | parity\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\n| `_create_project`, Command tab |\n| **Goal→need decomposition + project-linked queue/progress states user-facing** | **new (A4/B)** | `/api/projects`, de\u001b[0mm\u001b[0m\no 11 |\n| Calendar: ICS/JSON import → `calendar:event` source-evidence; steward scans upcoming; project linking | parity-level \u001b[0m|\u001b[0m\n `fn_import_calendar`, `link-calendar` |\n| `run-search` + adequacy gate (`search:run`, `search:adequacy`, `source:use` witnesses) | parity | `_run_search` |\n| `endorse-source` / `set-import-trust` raising inherited confidence | parity | `endorse-source` |\n----"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec","cognition.ai/terminalPreview":true}}}}
