Stewardship, projects, sources\n\n| Capability | Class | Where |\n|---|---|---|\n| Background steward: daemon thread running `steward-tick` tool; drains needs, countdown needs, calendar scan, source-c\u001b[0mo\u001b[0m\nnfidence, compact-check; each run recorded (`idle:steward-run`, ms) | parity | `app/steward.py`, `fn_steward_tick` |\n| **Stewardship configurable as ledger data: duties + interval via `assign-stewardship` (`routing:stewardship-assignmen\u001b[0mt\u001b[0m\n`), per-duty toggles** | **new (A3 / D-IdleTurnAsTool)** | `assign-stewardship`, Settings |\n| Responsiveness: steward never holds request path; probe measures API answer while tick runs | parity | `steward.py`, \u001b[0mp\u001b[0m\nrobe |\n| Projects: `project:*` subjects, goals as assertions, goals → linked needs, progress visible; create via chat | parity\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\n| `_create_project`, Command tab |\n| **Goal→need decomposition + project-linked queue/progress states user-facing** | **new (A4/B)** | `/api/projects`, de\u001b[0mm\u001b[0m\no 11 |\n| Calendar: ICS/JSON import → `calendar:event` source-evidence; steward scans upcoming; project linking | parity-level \u001b[0m|\u001b[0m\n `fn_import_calendar`, `link-calendar` |\n| `run-search` + adequacy gate (`search:run`, `search:adequacy`, `source:use` witnesses) | parity | `_run_search` |\n| `endorse-source` / `set-import-trust` raising inherited confidence | parity | `endorse-source` |\n----\n# Launch procedure — Meridian (version 0.3.0.001)\n\nRequirements: Windows + Python 3.10+ on PATH (no pip installs, stdlib only).\n\n## One-line launch\n\n```\nlaunch.cmd\n```\n\nor, equivalently:\n\n```\ncd \"version 0.3.0.001\"\npython -m app --port 9760 --open\n```\n\n## What a clean launch looks like\n\n1. Console prints the honesty banner: `ledger: durable`, engine modes\n   (`llm`, `tts`, `stt`, `portrait`), stub declarations, persona frame, and the\n   surface URL.\n2. A launch log is written to `evidence/launch/launch-<timestamp>.log` and a\n   machine-readable report to `runtime/last-launch.json` with `\"ok\": true`.\n3. The browser opens `http://127.0.0.1:9760` — the honesty banner at the top\n   carries the same engine modes and stub declarations (nothing is silent).\n4. `launch:report` and `launch:honesty` assertions are appended to the ledger\n   (visible in the Library tab).\n\n## Flags\n\n| Flag | Effect |\n|------|--------|\n| `--port N` | serve on port N (default 9760) |\n| `--runtime DIR` | use an alternate runtime dir |\n| `--no-steward` | do not start the background steward thread |\n| `--no-serve` | boot everything, skip the HTTP surface (used by demo harness) |\n| `--open` | open the browser |\n\n## Verification without the browser\n\n```\npython scripts\\probe.py\n```\n\n`probe.py` launches a second instance on port 9761, polls `/api/state` and\n`/api/honesty`, proves steward responsiveness while the server answers, writes\n`evidence/launch/probe-<timestamp>.json`, and exits — no manual env vars.\n\n## Stopping\n\nCtrl+C in the console, or close the window. The ledger is durable JSONL —\nstate survives restart (demonstration 8 in `evidence/demos/`)."}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec","cognition.ai/terminalPreview":true}}}}
