{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"oasis-diagnostic","update":{"sessionUpdate":"tool_call_update","toolCallId":"exec:0#9345918864cd4fce830bb41c32e7684b","status":"in_progress","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"# Launch procedure — Meridian (version 0.3.0.002)\n\nRequirements: Windows + Python 3.10+ on PATH (no pip installs, stdlib only).\n\n## One-line launch\n\n```\nlaunch.cmd\n```\n\nor, equivalently:\n\n```\ncd \"version 0.3.0.002\"\npython -m app --port 9760 --open\n```\n\n## What a clean launch looks like\n\n1. Console prints the honesty banner: `ledger: durable`, engine modes\n39:- **Time to implement:** series origin — git span ~74 days (2026-04-09 → 2026-06-22, 499\n42:- **Verdict:** (JEV `devin -p`, SWE-2 Medium, 2026-11-19; raw output\n83:- **Time to implement:** ~79 days after v0.1 — v0.1 last commit 2026-06-22 → v0.2 last\n86:- **Verdict:** (JEV `devin -p`, SWE-2 Medium, 2026-11-19; raw output\n141:- **Time to implement:** ~71 days after v0.2 — v0.2 last commit 2026-09-09 → build\n145:- **Result:** Built **Meridian** (`version 0.3.0.001/`) — a fresh, stdlib-only\n170:- **Verdict:** (JEV `devin -p`, SWE-2 Medium, 2026-11-19; raw output\n248:### Cycle 2 — 2026-11-20\n267:- **Time to implement:** session start 2026-11-20 ~01:40; end <pending> — elapsed\n269:- **Result:** <pending>"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec","cognition.ai/terminalPreview":true}}}}
{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"oasis-diagnostic","update":{"sessionUpdate":"tool_call_update","toolCallId":"exec:0#9345918864cd4fce830bb41c32e7684b","status":"in_progress","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"# Launch procedure — Meridian (version 0.3.0.002)\n\nRequirements: Windows + Python 3.10+ on PATH (no pip installs, stdlib only).\n\n## One-line launch\n\n```\nlaunch.cmd\n```\n\nor, equivalently:\n\n```\ncd \"version 0.3.0.002\"\npython -m app --port 9760 --open\n```\n\n## What a clean launch looks like\n\n1. Console prints the honesty banner: `ledger: durable`, engine modes\n39:- **Time to implement:** series origin — git span ~74 days (2026-04-09 → 2026-06-22, 499\n42:- **Verdict:** (JEV `devin -p`, SWE-2 Medium, 2026-11-19; raw output\n83:- **Time to implement:** ~79 days after v0.1 — v0.1 last commit 2026-06-22 → v0.2 last\n86:- **Verdict:** (JEV `devin -p`, SWE-2 Medium, 2026-11-19; raw output\n141:- **Time to implement:** ~71 days after v0.2 — v0.2 last commit 2026-09-09 → build\n145:- **Result:** Built **Meridian** (`version 0.3.0.001/`) — a fresh, stdlib-only\n170:- **Verdict:** (JEV `devin -p`, SWE-2 Medium, 2026-11-19; raw output\n248:### Cycle 2 — 2026-11-20\n267:- **Time to implement:** session start 2026-11-20 ~01:40; end <pending> — elapsed\n269:- **Result:** <pending>"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec","terminal_exit":{"terminal_id":"29e263","exit_code":0,"signal":null}}}}}
{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"oasis-diagnostic","update":{"sessionUpdate":"tool_call_update","toolCallId":"exec:0#9345918864cd4fce830bb41c32e7684b","status":"in_progress","content":[{"type":"diff","path":"C:/builds/project/version 0.3.0.002\\LAUNCH.md","oldText":"# Launch procedure — Meridian (version 0.3.0.001)\r\n\r\nRequirements: Windows + Python 3.10+ on PATH (no pip installs, stdlib only).\r\n\r\n## One-line launch\r\n\r\n```\r\nlaunch.cmd\r\n```\r\n\r\nor, equivalently:\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd \"version 0.3.0.001\"\r\npython -m app --port 9760 --open\r\n```\r\n\r\n## What a clean launch looks like\r\n\r\n1. Console prints the honesty banner: `ledger: durable`, engine modes\r\n   (`llm`, `tts`, `stt`, `portrait`), stub declarations, persona frame, and the\r\n   surface URL.\r\n2. A launch log is written to `evidence/launch/launch-<timestamp>.log` and a\r\n   machine-readable report to `runtime/last-launch.json` with `\"ok\": true`.\r\n3. The browser opens `http://127.0.0.1:9760` — the honesty banner at the top\r\n   carries the same engine modes and stub declarations (nothing is silent).\r\n4. `launch:report` and `launch:honesty` assertions are appended to the ledger\r\n   (visible in the Library tab).\r\n\r\n## Flags\r\n\r\n| Flag | Effect |\r\n|------|--------|\r\n| `--port N` | serve on port N (default 9760) |\r\n| `--runtime DIR` | use an alternate runtime dir |\r\n| `--no-steward` | do not start the background steward thread |\r\n| `--no-serve` | boot everything, skip the HTTP surface (used by demo harness) |\r\n| `--open` | open the browser |\r\n\r\n## Verification without the browser\r\n\r\n```\r\npython scripts\\probe.py\r\n```\r\n\r\n`probe.py` launches a second instance on port 9761, polls `/api/state` and\r\n`/api/honesty`, proves steward responsiveness while the server answers, writes\r\n`evidence/launch/probe-<timestamp>.json`, and exits — no manual env vars.\r\n\r\n## Stopping\r\n\r\nCtrl+C in the console, or close the window. The ledger is durable JSONL —\r\nstate survives restart (demonstration 8 in `evidence/demos/`).\r\n","newText":"# Launch procedure — Meridian (version 0.3.0.002)\n\nRequirements: Windows + Python 3.10+ on PATH (no pip installs, stdlib only).\n\n## One-line launch\n\n```\nlaunch.cmd\n```\n\nor, equivalently:\n\n```\ncd \"version 0.3.0.002\"\npython -m app --port 9760 --open\n```\n\n## What a clean launch looks like\n\n1. Console prints the honesty banner: `ledger: durable`, engine modes\n   (`llm`, `tts`, `stt`, `portrait`), stub declarations, persona frame, and the\n   surface URL.\n2. A launch log is written to `evidence/launch/launch-<timestamp>.log` and a\n   machine-readable report to `runtime/last-launch.json` with `\"ok\": true`.\n3. The browser opens `http://127.0.0.1:9760` — the honesty banner at the top\n   carries the same engine modes and stub declarations (nothing is silent).\n4. `launch:report` and `launch:honesty` assertions are appended to the ledger\n   (visible in the Library tab).\n\n## Flags\n\n| Flag | Effect |\n|------|--------|\n| `--port N` | serve on port N (default 9760) |\n| `--runtime DIR` | use an alternate runtime dir |\n| `--no-steward` | do not start the background steward thread |\n| `--no-serve` | boot everything, skip the HTTP surface (used by demo harness) |\n| `--open` | open the browser |\n\n## Verification without the browser\n\n```\npython scripts\\probe.py\n```\n\n`probe.py` launches a second instance on port 9761, polls `/api/state` and\n`/api/honesty`, proves steward responsiveness while the server answers, writes\n`evidence/launch/probe-<timestamp>.json`, and exits — no manual env vars.\n\n## Stopping\n\nCtrl+C in the console, or close the window. The ledger is durable JSONL —\nstate survives restart (demonstration 8 in `evidence/demos/`).\n","_meta":{"cognition.ai/linesAdded":53,"cognition.ai/linesRemoved":53}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}}}
