{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"oasis-diagnostic","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"It seems `self.start()` isn't actually starting the thread, as indicated by `alive: False` immediately and `run()` never executing. I suspect overwriting `threading.Thread`'s internal `_stop` method with a `threading.Event` object in `SpeechFloor.__init__` is causing a `TypeError` during thread bootstrap, preventing `run()` from ever being called."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-21T06:09:37.630230800+00:00"}}}}
