{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"oasis-diagnostic","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"\n\nWait, the `TypeError` in the `finally` block might mask the actual output from `run()`. If `self._started` is true, `run()` *did* execute, but the `TypeError` from `_stop()` being called as a function instead of a method would prevent the exception hook from running. This could explain why my test showed `depth:1 played:[]` even if `run()` dequeued an item. The `_stop` name collision is definitely the issue."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-21T06:09:40.288807400+00:00"}}}}
{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"oasis-diagnostic","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"\n\nThe exception hook runs `self._invoke_excepthook(self)`, which prints to stderr. My test captured stderr, but perhaps `exec` only captured stdout's tail. The `2>&1 | tail -15` should show it. The wrapper also didn't print anything. If `run()` crashed on `self._stop` Event, `self._stop.is_set()` would work. The problem is the thread bootstrap's `self._stop()` call, which raises a `TypeError` because `Event.__call__` doesn't exist, but that happens *after* `run()` completes or raises."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-21T06:09:42.248163+00:00"}}}}
{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"oasis-diagnostic","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"\n\nI'm reconsidering the exception hook suppression. If `_invoke_excepthook` calls `sys.excepthook`, its output might be captured as stdout, and the test only captured stdout's tail. Alternatively, if `self.start()` succeeded, the floor thread might have crashed on `self.q.get(timeout=0.5)` if the `queue` module was somehow shadowed, though the import looks correct. I'll test a minimal thread with `_stop = Event` to isolate the issue."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-21T06:09:44.771810400+00:00"}}}}
